y_mutual","type":"use_controls_body"},{"role":"changed_use","type":"body_controls_use"}],"movingLine":{"fullText":"干父之蛊，小有悔，无大咎。","terms":[],"automaticPolarityScore":null,"applicationMustBeCurated":true,"label":"九三","sourceRef":{"sourceId":"user-yijing64","startChar":19288,"endChar":19401,"startLine":763,"endLine":767}},"referenceContext":{"castingDate":"2026-11-11","dayGanzhi":"己丑","monthOrder":"autumn-metal","monthBranches":["申","酉"],"purpose":"explicit-qi-comparison-and-date-render-test;not-real-simultaneous-seasonal-casts"}},"decision":{"id":"career.interview.interview-pass/18/3/autumn-metal/not-pass-this-round","outcomeCode":"not-pass-this-round","question_type":"interview_pass","questionScope":"one-interview-stage","method":"project-application-of-fame-chapter;not-a-verbatim-classical-interview-rule","sourceIds":["mh-056","mh-058","mh-071","mh-101","mh-116","mh-117","mh-119","mh-143","user-void-extension","user-void-timing"],"counterevidence":[{"fact":"木死克体弱，爻有无大咎，变用受体克","resolution":"说明初期压力减轻；体休生旺金耗较重，末后克相水仍费力且无直接生体，以落实困难取未通过。"}],"lineApplication":{"evidence":["小有悔","无大咎"],"conditions":["承认可以修正，不把无大咎直接当成考察已经通过"],"allDetectedTerms":[]},"indirectEffectsApplied":[],"interpretationProvenance":"assistant-authored;not-observed-feedback;not-scientifically-verified-prediction"},"copy":{"title":"牵制虽减，这轮仍较难落实","short":{"decisionId":"career.interview.interview-pass/18/3/autumn-metal/not-pass-this-round","text":"这轮面试倾向难以通过。前面的压力未必很强，但中间的解释耗费较多，最后仍缺少把结果落实的帮助。把不清楚的要求问明白，及时补足回答；应期留意本轮受阻或不利反馈，后续继续安排其他机会，不必反复强求这一次。"},"long":{"decisionId":"career.interview.interview-pass/18/3/autumn-metal/not-pass-this-round","opening":"起初存在牵制，但分量有所减轻。艮土体秋令属休，巽木用属死而克体，要求仍需回应，压力却不如木旺时那样重。可以争取解释的机会。","process":"中间更容易感到费心。体互震木属死，克体作用较弱；用互兑金当旺，受体土所生，对本已偏弱的体土形成较明显的耗费。宜把回答收在重点上，减少无关铺陈。","ending":"九三“小有悔，无大咎”，保留了调整后避免问题扩大的余地。变用坎水属相，虽受体土所克，体土偏弱，想落实结果仍不轻松。初期牵制较弱未能补上中段耗费，这轮取通过偏难。","summary":"本轮倾向难过，但反馈仍有修正价值。把需要调整的地方落实到准备中，再争取下一次。"}},"timingSlots":[{"id":"result","kind":"control","role":"use","event":"本