分答完整。","process":"中段的耗费更明显。体互巽木属死，克体作用较轻；用互兑金当旺，受体土所生，偏弱体土仍需持续投入精力。把回答放在重点上，减少无关铺陈。","ending":"上六“弗遇过之；飞鸟离之，凶，是谓灾眚”，对当前过越、失遇持不利态度。变用离火属囚，来生体，帮助有限，难把末后的结果推动起来。这轮取通过偏难。","summary":"本轮偏向不通过。把可以核实的问题整理好，逐项修正，再准备下一次面试。"}},"timingSlots":[{"id":"result","kind":"control","role":"use","event":"本轮面试推进受阻或收到不利反馈","valence":"凶","ruleIds":["adverse-event"],"sourceIds":["mh-116","mh-143"],"prefix":"留意","suffix":"前后的本轮面试进展，推进受阻或出现不利反馈的意味较重，属凶应。收到实际反馈后再安排下一步。","token":"{{date:result}}","branches":["寅","卯"],"displayLimit":2,"method":"element-qi","scale":"day","emptyText":"本次可显示范围内暂无相应候选日期。"}],"baseProse":true,"coreVoidNotes":["变用离卦逢空，但本身发动，仍有作用。"],"voidReleaseSpecs":[],"voidTimingSlots":[],"voidTimingText":"","lineApplication":{"evidence":["弗遇过之","飞鸟离之","凶","是谓灾眚"],"conditions":["不编造面试真实经过，不把灾眚扩成现实人身灾害"]},"counterevidence":[{"fact":"两木死克体较轻，末后火仍生体","resolution":"保留压力减轻；体土休生旺金耗明显、火囚助弱，与完整爻凶相合，取当前落实困难。"}],"sourceIds":["mh-056","mh-058","mh-071","mh-101","mh-116","mh-117","mh-119","mh-143","user-void-extension","user-void-timing"],"review":{"status":"author-checked","actor":"assistant-author","version":"interview-pass-1.1.0","scope":"base-prose-and-recorded-void-profile;equivalent-qi-month-slots-share-written-text;exempt-core-void-does-not-change-verdict","verification":"computed-facts-plus-authored-judgment;not-independent-human-expert-certification","checks":{"chart-and-moving-line":{"status":"pass","evidence":[{"sourceId":"project-interview-authoring","locator":"62/6","reason":"Canonical six-line, mutual and one-line change recalculation"}]},"body-use-position":{"status":"pass","evidence":[{"sourceId":"project-interview-authoring","locator":"canonical-role-assignment","reason":"Original body is retained in all three stages"}]},"question-method-match":{"status":"pass","evidence":[{"sourceId":"project-interview-authoring","locator":"mh-071;project-interview-stage-application-v1","reason":"Fame chapter applied to this interview stage, separate from offer"}]},"relation-directions":{"stat